[00:10.000]I feel like a bag of death, nothing helps the pain decay
{"我像具行尸走肉 任何止痛都失效"}
[00:15.076]Adding up all the people I hope I subtract away
{"清算我渴望抹除的每张面孔"}
[00:19.945]My body looks like porcelain since I haven't seen a day
{"苍白如瓷的身体 不见天日太久"}
[00:25.047]Where color was an option, I'm drowned out by all the same
{"当色彩成为奢望 我被单调淹没"}
[00:28.838]I just keep kicking around
{"我只能继续苟延残喘"}
[00:31.469]And I will never come out
{"永远找不到出口"}
[00:34.247]You'll never see me I doubt
{"你永远看不见我 我确信"}
[00:36.592]No, no, no, no, no, no, no, you can't lock me up
{"不　不　不　不　不　不　不　你休想将我禁锢"}
[00:39.244]Yeah, let's have fun with a gun
{"来用枪械找点乐子吧"}
[00:41.791]I love the chase and the hunt
{"我迷恋追捕与猎杀"}
[00:44.271]Yeah, light me up like the sun
{"来把我点燃成烈日吧"}
[00:46.697]No, no, no, no, no, no, no, you can't lock me up
{"不　不　不　不　不　不　不　你休想将我禁锢"}
[00:50.503]
[00:55.507]Nothing's gotten brighter like you promised that it would
{"世界没如你承诺般变明亮"}
[01:00.535]Maybe I should go to Hell like you believe I should
{"或许我该下地狱 如你所愿"}
[01:05.566]There I'll raise my family, it's all I've ever known
